      <p><b>The Dark Knight</b> is a superhero movie about <i>Batman</i>, who protects <i>Gotham</i> from dangerous criminals. In this story, <i>Batman</i> faces his greatest enemy, <i>the Joker</i>, a criminal who creates fear and chaos in the city. <i>Batman</i> works with <i>Commissioner Gordon</i> and <i>Harvey Dent</i> to stop <i>the Joker</i> and save innocent people. <i>The Joker</i> tries to prove that even good people can be broken by fear and pain. In the end, <i>Batman</i> makes a difficult sacrifice to protect Gotham’s hope and reputation. The movie shows courage, justice, and the struggle between good and evil. </p>
      
      
